  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "The Empty Freezer",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: Nice work back there. It's answering honestly now — that's step one.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-e0a9bcf5-aa9e-443d-a879-725e04f602e9",
        "typing": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": false
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: But we've got a new problem. This morning it told someone \"Yes, we have mango sorbet!\" ...We sold the last mango sorbet an hour ago.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-0c3cc5e2-306f-4680-a231-81a4c98f04fd",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: See, the menu board says what we SELL. The freezer says what we HAVE RIGHT NOW. Those are two different questions.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-5ea2ca70-9731-48d5-8da0-199f0863e0d3",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: The menu never changes. The freezer changes every single order. Your agent needs to check BOTH.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-8823d531-5f2b-49fe-b76e-6f7a4c0a5204",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: And hey — see that sign on the wall? \"Nobody leaves without a scoop.\" If we're out of something, don't just say no. Suggest something else.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-7b46e7f5-ca1e-4332-a4c3-fba6bd9b9c34",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "# 🔓 TOOL UNLOCKED: Freezer\n\nSees what's actually in stock right now.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-fee4b686-0582-462c-9774-c2f0ced0f100",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "# 🔓 TOOL UNLOCKED: Suggest\n\nRecommends a flavor from what we've got.",
